flowchart LR
  M[Inbound communication] --> C[Client]
  C --> N[Case creation]
  N --> T[Case Type]
  T --> W[Work Package]
  W --> K[Task]
  K --> D[Document]
  D --> V[Version]
  V --> R[Review]
  R --> L[Lawyer decision]
  L --> A[Deadline / agenda]
  A --> H[Time]
  H --> P[Publication / client communication]
  P --> X[Case close]
